@startuml Sequence Diagram - Notes-Service (Create Record)
actor Physician
participant RecordController
participant AppointmentRecordRepository

Physician -> RecordController: POST /records (RecordRequest)
RecordController -> AppointmentRecord: new AppointmentRecord(appointmentId, diagnosis, ...)
RecordController -> AppointmentRecordRepository: save(record)
AppointmentRecordRepository --> RecordController: record saved
RecordController --> Physician: ResponseEntity.ok(record)
@enduml
